WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.725
- (laughter) What are you doing?

00:00:10.475 --> 00:00:13.091
- So tonight I'm hosting a
slumber party for a few guys

00:00:13.091 --> 00:00:15.982
around the office because
they've never had a slumber party

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.004
before and they seem pretty clueless.

00:00:18.004 --> 00:00:20.463
- Pillow fights. That's a thing, right?

00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:21.614
- Pillow fights, for sure.

00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:23.420
- Yeah, no, pillow fights are not a thing.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.242
I've come up for a few
activities for them,

00:00:25.242 --> 00:00:26.347
so I hope they're excited.

00:00:26.347 --> 00:00:27.550
- Yeah, very excited.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.665
- I am so down.

00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:31.782
- So, I'm sitting here and
it's been legit almost an hour,

00:00:31.782 --> 00:00:33.956
I have no clue what they could be doing.

00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:35.333
- Any whipped cream on that?

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:38.834
- Oh yeah, for sure.
- Oh yeah, for sure.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.153
- Jasmine, what are we gonna be doing?

00:00:40.153 --> 00:00:43.762
- First, you guys are going
to be applying face masks

00:00:43.762 --> 00:00:45.074
to each other.

00:00:45.074 --> 00:00:46.154
- That feels great.

00:00:46.154 --> 00:00:47.880
- That is like a legit mask. (laughs)

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.979
- Don't shake my head too
much, just lost a cucumber.

00:00:49.979 --> 00:00:51.261
- You kind of look...

00:00:51.261 --> 00:00:53.105
- Terrifying?
- Oh god.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.915
- Look, you're supposed to try and relax.

00:00:54.915 --> 00:00:56.152
- There you go, now just relax, buddy.

00:00:56.152 --> 00:00:57.459
- More with your fingers.

00:00:57.459 --> 00:01:00.054
- I'm going to, I'm just
squeezing it all out first.

00:01:00.054 --> 00:01:01.653
Uh oh, I got some on your
onesie too, by the way.

00:01:01.653 --> 00:01:02.965
- Let me take off my face.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:04.121
- Whoa, dude.

00:01:04.121 --> 00:01:05.827
- It's like peeling the
plastic off of a new iPhone.

00:01:05.827 --> 00:01:06.877
- You're the new iPhone.

00:01:06.877 --> 00:01:07.803
- I'm the new iPhone.

00:01:07.803 --> 00:01:10.324
- So I'm deciding on having
them do a two minute manicure

00:01:10.324 --> 00:01:13.409
because it is the hardest
thing to do and I also think

00:01:13.409 --> 00:01:16.831
it's ever harder painting
someone else's fingernails.

00:01:16.831 --> 00:01:18.765
- I look really good in green,

00:01:18.765 --> 00:01:21.087
but I also like the color purple.

00:01:21.087 --> 00:01:22.366
- Do you wanna do both?

00:01:22.366 --> 00:01:23.350
- Let's do both.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.343
- Gustav, how's your family?

00:01:24.343 --> 00:01:26.455
- My family is great, can't
wait for them to see this video.

00:01:26.455 --> 00:01:28.029
- Kenny, you're gonna look fabulous.

00:01:28.029 --> 00:01:29.620
- Thank you.
- (laughs) Shit.

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.523
- Believe in me, okay?

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:31.765
- I believe in you.

00:01:31.765 --> 00:01:33.902
- This ring finger looks like
it's doing a walk of shame.

00:01:33.902 --> 00:01:37.172
- I did a pretty good
job with you. Am I wrong?

00:01:37.172 --> 00:01:38.977
- No, absolutely not, it was horrible.

00:01:38.977 --> 00:01:42.328
I had the worst set of
nails at the entire party.

00:01:42.328 --> 00:01:45.760
- The third activity will be pillow talk.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.735
I'm having them do pillow
talk because I feel like it's

00:01:47.735 --> 00:01:51.196
